WEBVTT

00:31.630 --> 00:35.180
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.200 --> 00:38.580
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.850 --> 00:44.820
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.980 --> 00:49.610
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.630 --> 00:53.140
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:53.160 --> 00:56.650
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.670 --> 01:00.180
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.200 --> 01:06.260
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.520 --> 01:23.800
Si Jin

01:23.820 --> 01:28.080
Episode 40

01:28.100 --> 01:30.160
I'm no groveling

01:30.180 --> 01:32.370
supplicant,

01:33.020 --> 01:34.650
yet no one

01:36.660 --> 01:38.220
in this world has ever

01:38.300 --> 01:39.740
understood me

01:40.180 --> 01:41.620
or loved me.

01:43.460 --> 01:45.930
Still, I cannot be called defeated.

01:46.460 --> 01:47.830
From this day forward,

01:47.850 --> 01:50.500
you will never forget Rongyang.

01:51.380 --> 01:52.820
Father!

02:08.890 --> 02:14.370
♪ Life is like flowers,
blooming and fading with the seasons ♪

02:15.400 --> 02:20.550
♪ Wind leaves marks,
swaying in the breeze ♪

02:21.170 --> 02:24.290
♪ I don't wish for favors from the heavens ♪

02:24.310 --> 02:27.280
♪ To enjoy a blessed life ♪

02:27.500 --> 02:34.300
♪ I only wish to be unburdened ♪

02:34.720 --> 02:39.910
♪ Fate's been written; we're its slaves ♪

02:41.110 --> 02:46.230
♪ I dare not look back
at the road I came from ♪

02:46.740 --> 02:49.890
♪ As the sun sets, the wise seek redemption ♪

02:49.890 --> 02:53.460
♪ I only wish to wake up one day ♪

02:53.500 --> 02:59.400
♪ I won't lose with myself in the game ♪

02:59.420 --> 03:05.900
♪ Alas, is it too late
to stop indulging myself ♪

03:05.920 --> 03:12.320
♪ Is it too difficult to be free from sorrow ♪

03:12.340 --> 03:15.490
♪ How many regrets are left ♪

03:15.510 --> 03:19.220
♪ To be remedied ♪

03:19.240 --> 03:25.080
♪ A small greed forms an unbreakable tie ♪

03:25.100 --> 03:31.350
♪ Is the resting shore too shallow ♪

03:31.370 --> 03:37.830
♪ Is the yearning in my heart too distant ♪

03:37.850 --> 03:41.110
♪ The wildflowers bloom across the mountains ♪

03:41.110 --> 03:44.770
♪ Yet I remain trapped ♪

03:44.790 --> 03:52.100
♪ A shared bond, a tragic ending ♪

03:53.990 --> 03:59.970
♪ Is the resting shore too shallow ♪

03:59.990 --> 04:06.010
♪ Is the yearning in my heart too distant ♪

04:06.030 --> 04:09.160
♪ The wildflowers bloom across the mountains ♪

04:09.160 --> 04:12.750
♪ Yet I remain trapped ♪

04:12.750 --> 04:18.690
♪ A shared bond, a tragic ending ♪

04:18.710 --> 04:21.230
♪ A shared bond ♪

04:21.230 --> 04:27.620
♪ A tragic ending ♪

04:42.560 --> 04:44.840
(Tiande Hall)

04:46.300 --> 04:48.760
(The rebel, Marquis Changxing, )

04:48.780 --> 04:52.050
(is sentenced to death by a thousand cuts.)

04:52.420 --> 04:55.370
(Grand Princess Rongyang sacrificed herself)

04:55.370 --> 04:57.090
(to protect the Emperor.)

04:57.300 --> 04:59.470
(She's honored as Grand Princess Xianjing)

04:59.490 --> 05:01.610
(in the Imperial Mausoleum.)

05:04.490 --> 05:06.780
(Cui Xu's appointed Duke of the State.)

05:06.780 --> 05:08.910
(Jiang Zhan, General of Defense.)

05:08.930 --> 05:11.200
(Long Dan, Chief Imperial Insignia Guard.)

05:11.220 --> 05:13.840
(Xie Yinlou, Commandant of Capital Security.)

05:13.860 --> 05:16.090
(Zhen Heng, Vice Prime Minister.)

06:13.810 --> 06:16.340
I meant to fly the kite

06:16.570 --> 06:18.550
to send you a message,

06:18.570 --> 06:20.010
but...

06:26.620 --> 06:28.060
I know.

06:28.340 --> 06:29.780
I know it all.

06:31.220 --> 06:32.660
Still,

06:34.450 --> 06:36.460
I need to see for myself you're fine.

06:40.050 --> 06:42.580
I thought I'd never see you again.

06:50.420 --> 06:51.860
Fuqing,

06:52.690 --> 06:54.290
I want to marry you

06:55.220 --> 06:56.820
and grow old with you.

06:58.620 --> 07:00.170
Will you marry me?

07:07.250 --> 07:08.940
You once asked me

07:09.890 --> 07:11.470
why I refused the betrothal

07:11.490 --> 07:12.910
by His Majesty.

07:12.930 --> 07:14.320
Why did you

07:14.340 --> 07:16.650
refuse to marry me that day?

07:18.980 --> 07:20.420
Back then,

07:21.340 --> 07:22.660
I only saw you as a student.

07:22.660 --> 07:24.580
I wouldn't dare hope for more.

07:24.740 --> 07:27.020
But after this near-death experience,

07:28.010 --> 07:29.530
I realize

07:29.930 --> 07:31.970
you're always in my heart.

07:32.490 --> 07:34.050
It beats for you.

07:35.660 --> 07:37.030
Others might've only seen

07:37.050 --> 07:38.820
that you're soft and delicate

07:39.010 --> 07:40.610
while in my eyes,

07:40.860 --> 07:42.200
you're brave

07:42.220 --> 07:43.970
and tough.

07:44.340 --> 07:46.140
I'm conquered by you.

07:46.300 --> 07:48.090
Although you were in the dark,

07:48.180 --> 07:51.490
you tried to light up others.

07:52.570 --> 07:53.570
You'd protect them

07:53.570 --> 07:55.090
in your own way

07:55.890 --> 07:57.330
despite the fact

07:57.890 --> 08:00.170
that you were suffering in silence.

08:01.660 --> 08:03.530
I accept you for who you are.

08:03.570 --> 08:05.010
I just want you

08:05.810 --> 08:07.250
to be happy,

08:07.420 --> 08:08.860
free,

08:08.890 --> 08:10.530
and healthy.

08:11.860 --> 08:13.940
Our feelings are mutual.

08:14.690 --> 08:17.470
So will you marry me?

08:17.490 --> 08:19.090
Yes, I'll marry you!

08:33.620 --> 08:37.090
Thank you for everything, Jin.

08:37.170 --> 08:39.770
It's all thanks to General Cui.

08:42.460 --> 08:44.370
You little cheat!

08:44.650 --> 08:46.490
Don't play games with me.

08:47.530 --> 08:49.080
Cui Xu came

08:49.100 --> 08:50.890
because of Jiang Si, right?

08:54.530 --> 08:56.250
She's a wonderful girl.

08:56.460 --> 08:58.060
You have good taste.

08:59.820 --> 09:01.770
I appreciate your compliment.

09:03.820 --> 09:05.110
By the way, Father,

09:05.130 --> 09:06.630
I've returned

09:06.650 --> 09:07.580
the Jade Seal

09:07.580 --> 09:09.850
you entrusted me with in perilous time.

09:15.170 --> 09:16.700
You've grown up.

09:17.650 --> 09:19.370
What plans do you have?

09:20.410 --> 09:22.010
Tell me about them.

09:23.580 --> 09:25.720
I want to go to Nanwu

09:25.740 --> 09:27.180
to see Jiang Si.

09:27.460 --> 09:28.340
Go to Nanwu?

09:28.340 --> 09:29.780
Yes.

09:31.530 --> 09:34.130
I'll agree to anything

09:34.220 --> 09:35.470
but not that.

09:35.490 --> 09:38.080
This isn't the best time to go there.

09:38.100 --> 09:40.420
When... when is the best time?

09:46.360 --> 09:49.480
(Tiande Hall)

09:49.490 --> 09:50.650
I'll never set foot

09:50.650 --> 09:52.300
in Tiande Hall again.

09:55.650 --> 09:57.220
As for the timing,

09:57.580 --> 09:58.700
that'll be

09:58.700 --> 10:00.660
your decision to make.

10:02.490 --> 10:03.940
Over the years,

10:04.220 --> 10:05.170
because of Rongyang,

10:05.170 --> 10:07.580
your mother has fought with me a lot.

10:07.700 --> 10:09.730
After this latest scare,

10:10.290 --> 10:12.130
I want to spend some time with her

10:12.700 --> 10:14.280
and take her away to relax.

11:02.840 --> 11:10.360
(Tiande Hall)

11:12.040 --> 11:16.360
(Nanwu)

11:28.370 --> 11:29.720
Grand Elder,

11:29.740 --> 11:32.270
these are the finest spices.

11:32.290 --> 11:34.460
They're rarely seen in Dazhou.

11:34.620 --> 11:35.800
Nanwu

11:35.820 --> 11:37.320
abounds with such spices.

11:37.340 --> 11:40.090
Look. Incense is made in every household.

11:40.290 --> 11:41.470
Grand Elder,

11:41.490 --> 11:43.300
have you considered

11:43.340 --> 11:45.610
encouraging the locals to do business?

11:46.770 --> 11:48.210
Do business?

11:48.650 --> 11:50.110
Nanwu has

11:50.130 --> 11:52.220
never had any merchants,

11:52.370 --> 11:55.110
only farmers and soldiers.

11:55.130 --> 11:56.130
Military expenses

11:56.130 --> 11:58.250
can be a heavy burden.

11:58.370 --> 11:59.720
If there's no war,

11:59.740 --> 12:00.860
the soldiers can

12:00.860 --> 12:02.390
return home

12:02.410 --> 12:04.010
to make a living.

12:04.490 --> 12:06.110
As for farmers,

12:06.130 --> 12:07.490
your topography

12:07.510 --> 12:09.430
isn't suitable for farming.

12:09.650 --> 12:11.490
What would we eat without it?

12:11.700 --> 12:13.750
Farming is for self-sufficiency.

12:13.770 --> 12:16.010
If you couldn't even support yourselves,

12:16.010 --> 12:18.230
you had to join the army and fight

12:18.250 --> 12:20.560
with your lives for more resources.

12:20.580 --> 12:21.840
Actually,

12:21.860 --> 12:22.980
there's a better option

12:22.980 --> 12:23.980
for you.

12:23.980 --> 12:25.440
Nanwu is rich in spices,

12:25.460 --> 12:27.080
which are in high demand in Dazhou

12:27.100 --> 12:29.370
despite their high prices.

12:29.490 --> 12:30.740
If the people here

12:30.740 --> 12:32.270
start doing business

12:32.290 --> 12:33.700
by bringing those rare spices

12:33.700 --> 12:35.200
to Dazhou

12:35.220 --> 12:36.960
in exchange for what they need,

12:36.980 --> 12:38.980
that way, even without farming,

12:38.980 --> 12:39.940
they will

12:39.940 --> 12:41.800
lead a better life.

12:41.820 --> 12:42.820
Who'd

12:42.820 --> 12:44.820
risk their lives in battle instead?

12:46.370 --> 12:48.090
Do you mean

12:48.820 --> 12:50.490
to sell these spices

12:50.740 --> 12:51.990
to Dazhou

12:52.010 --> 12:54.770
for food, ironware,

12:55.290 --> 12:57.340
and other necessities?

12:58.370 --> 13:00.200
Everyone will get what they need.

13:00.220 --> 13:01.350
Our people's lives

13:01.370 --> 13:03.560
will be greatly improved.

13:03.580 --> 13:05.350
In that case,

13:05.370 --> 13:06.340
the 100-year-long clash

13:06.340 --> 13:08.060
will finally end.

13:08.580 --> 13:11.700
Perhaps it is a better option.

13:11.980 --> 13:15.060
Alright. We'll do it your way.

13:15.460 --> 13:17.080
Let's carry it out

13:17.100 --> 13:18.770
as the Saintess said.

13:57.700 --> 13:59.080
So heavy!

13:59.100 --> 14:00.720
- Don't drop it.
- Yes.

14:24.480 --> 14:29.830
♪ It's a long story;
we'll take different paths in this life ♪

14:31.040 --> 14:37.160
♪ The world is changing;
may we find where we belong ♪

14:37.660 --> 14:44.240
♪ I want nothing else; I'll stop for you ♪

14:45.290 --> 14:46.730
Chief, it's...

14:49.940 --> 14:51.380
Your Majesty,

14:51.490 --> 14:52.750
it's too heavy.

14:52.770 --> 14:53.610
Wear it for a day

14:53.620 --> 14:55.580
and it might bend your neck.

14:58.660 --> 15:04.420
♪ Mottled fate reaches the end ♪

15:05.090 --> 15:11.160
♪ Hope to embrace eternity with you ♪

15:11.170 --> 15:13.220
May you be blessed

15:14.530 --> 15:16.610
with many children

15:17.740 --> 15:19.730
to continue the family line

15:20.460 --> 15:23.060
and make your clan thrive.

15:23.620 --> 15:25.160
Complete!

15:25.180 --> 15:28.630
♪ Forgetting the past, how many can make it ♪

15:28.650 --> 15:30.090
Put them away.

15:30.980 --> 15:32.040
Are you sure?

15:32.060 --> 15:35.870
♪ Looking at the past ♪

15:35.890 --> 15:37.630
Wait until she comes back to try them on.

15:37.650 --> 15:39.090
Yes.

15:41.650 --> 15:42.870
Jiang Si.

15:42.890 --> 15:44.460
Chuchu, sit with me.

15:49.010 --> 15:50.440
My dear Saintess,

15:50.460 --> 15:51.700
you've worked nonstop

15:51.700 --> 15:53.130
for Nanwu.

15:53.250 --> 15:54.720
It's time to take a break.

15:54.740 --> 15:55.580
Chuchu,

15:55.580 --> 15:56.770
I invited you over

15:56.770 --> 15:58.420
to tell you something.

15:58.630 --> 16:01.220
Could I trouble you to return to Dazhou?

16:01.370 --> 16:03.060
I can go back to Ling'an?

16:05.100 --> 16:06.230
What about you?

16:06.250 --> 16:07.690
Won't you come along?

16:07.980 --> 16:10.420
I can't return yet.

16:10.740 --> 16:11.960
When you get back,

16:11.980 --> 16:13.010
tell my sister and others

16:13.010 --> 16:14.130
about the situation here.

16:14.130 --> 16:15.850
I need their help.

16:16.250 --> 16:18.560
Then find out what spices

16:18.580 --> 16:20.440
the rich and powerful in Ling'an prefer.

16:20.460 --> 16:21.650
Please make a list of them

16:21.650 --> 16:23.150
and send it to me.

16:23.170 --> 16:24.470
Sure.

16:24.490 --> 16:25.410
Once Dazhou

16:25.410 --> 16:27.110
and Nanwu can trade with each other,

16:27.130 --> 16:28.170
don't forget my help.

16:28.170 --> 16:29.320
I won't!

16:29.340 --> 16:30.630
Take a look.

16:30.650 --> 16:32.980
These are the rare spices in Nanwu

16:32.980 --> 16:35.230
I've collected lately.

16:35.250 --> 16:37.370
To Yu Jin.

16:37.410 --> 16:38.770
I've made a pact

16:38.770 --> 16:40.470
with Nanwu for a year.

16:40.490 --> 16:41.650
During this period,

16:41.650 --> 16:43.110
I'll stay there

16:43.130 --> 16:44.750
and make Nanwu prosper

16:44.770 --> 16:45.620
as never before

16:45.620 --> 16:47.320
without going to war.

16:47.340 --> 16:48.970
I'm confident of it.

16:51.170 --> 16:54.180
She didn't mention me at all.

16:54.730 --> 16:55.800
Your Majesty,

16:55.820 --> 16:57.630
Minister Zhen came to see you.

16:57.650 --> 16:59.040
Send him in.

16:59.060 --> 17:01.290
Grand Princess Fuqing also came.

17:16.860 --> 17:18.560
- Zhen Heng
- Fuqing

17:18.580 --> 17:20.220
- greets you, Your Majesty.
- greets you, Your Majesty.

17:23.410 --> 17:27.140
You came together, huh?

17:31.410 --> 17:32.850
What's up?

17:36.690 --> 17:38.180
I, Zhen Heng,

17:38.340 --> 17:40.770
sincerely hope to marry
Grand Princess Fuqing

17:40.820 --> 17:42.660
to forever tie the knot.

17:42.970 --> 17:46.530
People call me rigid, dull,

17:46.730 --> 17:48.870
and stubborn as a mule.

17:48.890 --> 17:51.490
They aren't wrong.

17:51.860 --> 17:53.390
But only Fuqing

17:53.410 --> 17:55.190
accepts all my shortcomings

17:55.210 --> 17:56.810
and truly admires me.

17:57.170 --> 17:58.190
Your Majesty,

17:58.210 --> 18:00.460
after Marquis Changxing's rebel earlier,

18:00.500 --> 18:01.910
it became clearer to me

18:01.930 --> 18:04.840
that I should cherish the most

18:04.860 --> 18:06.350
the one by my side.

18:06.370 --> 18:09.280
I promise to devote my life

18:09.300 --> 18:11.100
to Grand Princess Fuqing.

18:11.170 --> 18:12.970
I'll respect her and love her.

18:13.020 --> 18:15.080
Please grant our marriage, Your Majesty.

18:15.540 --> 18:17.560
Do you, who are by his side,

18:17.580 --> 18:19.380
think the same?

18:22.020 --> 18:24.570
His wish is my wish.

18:27.500 --> 18:28.940
Minister Zhen,

18:30.300 --> 18:33.420
I've never seen you like this before.

18:33.780 --> 18:36.190
Please stop making fun of me.

18:36.210 --> 18:37.650
Get up already.

18:38.540 --> 18:39.980
Thanks, Your Majesty.

18:40.450 --> 18:42.600
Don't act like Romeo and Juliet.

18:42.620 --> 18:44.050
If it got out,

18:44.070 --> 18:46.490
others would call me inhuman.

18:48.020 --> 18:49.380
Minister Zhen,

18:50.020 --> 18:50.970
Fuqing,

18:50.970 --> 18:52.460
I'll attend

18:52.480 --> 18:54.220
your wedding in person

18:56.410 --> 18:58.220
and give you

18:58.540 --> 19:01.860
this, this, and this.

19:02.210 --> 19:04.130
It's as fine as emerald and jade,

19:04.130 --> 19:06.320
the best of the best.

19:06.340 --> 19:07.500
I handpicked it

19:07.500 --> 19:09.460
for you in particular.

19:10.970 --> 19:12.350
Oh,

19:12.370 --> 19:14.430
and this too.

19:14.450 --> 19:18.620
A gold-clad turtle with jade shards.

19:19.650 --> 19:21.530
Those gifts you said

19:21.930 --> 19:23.840
seem quite familiar.

19:23.860 --> 19:25.280
But I think

19:25.300 --> 19:27.530
nothing can be better

19:27.890 --> 19:29.770
than your approval.

19:33.260 --> 19:34.700
Granted.

19:35.300 --> 19:36.740
You have my approval!

19:37.590 --> 19:38.950
Thanks, Your Majesty.

19:43.060 --> 19:44.280
Look, Grand Elder.

19:44.300 --> 19:45.300
These goods

19:45.300 --> 19:46.210
will be sent to Dazhou

19:46.210 --> 19:47.680
as well as those spices.

20:16.370 --> 20:17.810
Your Majesty,

20:17.970 --> 20:19.700
a letter for you.

20:30.130 --> 20:32.390
Please find the attached book
of Nanwu's herbs.

20:32.410 --> 20:34.340
It includes various prescriptions

20:34.340 --> 20:35.480
for unusual diseases, too.

20:35.500 --> 20:37.210
They can help our people.

20:37.210 --> 20:38.650
(To Yu Jin)

20:38.650 --> 20:40.150
Although reform is never easy,

20:40.170 --> 20:41.760
it's started making Nanwu better.

20:41.780 --> 20:44.190
I need hydraulicians from Dazhou

20:44.210 --> 20:46.320
to help Nanwu build dikes and dams

20:46.340 --> 20:47.890
to protect their farmland.

20:48.210 --> 20:50.220
Also... I miss you

20:50.260 --> 20:51.730
and Er'niu.

20:54.370 --> 20:55.620
Did she write to me

20:55.620 --> 20:57.430
only to help Nanwu

20:57.450 --> 20:58.890
build dikes and dams?

21:04.170 --> 21:05.970
If one day,

21:06.210 --> 21:08.050
I leave Ling'an,

21:08.540 --> 21:11.180
I'll go to a beautiful place

21:11.410 --> 21:13.000
and

21:13.020 --> 21:16.000
buy a small farm and a cottage

21:16.020 --> 21:17.170
to settle down

21:17.170 --> 21:20.180
and lead a simple yet free life.

21:21.020 --> 21:22.110
I'll

21:22.130 --> 21:23.520
bring with me my father,

21:23.540 --> 21:25.970
my siblings,

21:26.020 --> 21:29.110
Chuchu, Aman,

21:29.130 --> 21:30.570
Long Dan,

21:31.170 --> 21:32.610
and...

21:33.540 --> 21:35.050
and Er'niu!

21:37.410 --> 21:38.940
Good. Very well.

21:39.580 --> 21:41.330
And you too.

21:43.020 --> 21:44.660
Will you go with me?

21:49.100 --> 21:51.670
Have someone send Er'niu to her.

21:51.690 --> 21:53.130
She misses him.

21:54.300 --> 21:55.740
Yes.

22:06.960 --> 22:12.240
(Report)

22:42.400 --> 22:48.320
(Fragrant and Sparse)

22:51.060 --> 22:52.390
Poor pigeon.

22:52.410 --> 22:54.630
It has to fly so far only to send two words.

22:59.820 --> 23:01.260
Miss you.

23:13.540 --> 23:15.280
You're the Emperor.

23:15.300 --> 23:17.660
Couldn't you bring more attendants?

23:17.820 --> 23:20.060
These books aren't enough, are they?

23:20.060 --> 23:20.980
Still not enough?

23:20.980 --> 23:22.110
Even if Si read all day,

23:22.110 --> 23:23.620
it'd take her years to finish them all.

23:23.620 --> 23:24.480
I bought all the books

23:24.480 --> 23:25.780
I could find over there.

23:25.780 --> 23:27.480
What do you think? Are they enough?

23:27.500 --> 23:28.860
They seem ample altogether.

23:28.860 --> 23:30.300
Right?

23:30.370 --> 23:31.860
Let's check other places.

23:32.130 --> 23:33.050
Other places?

23:33.050 --> 23:35.960
(The Commentary of Zuo
on the Spring and Autumn Annals)

23:36.820 --> 23:38.840
Pack them all and send them to her.

23:38.860 --> 23:40.300
Yes.

23:46.680 --> 23:48.720
(To Jiang Si)

23:49.440 --> 23:53.560
(To Jiang Si)

23:53.880 --> 23:59.200
(To Jiang Si)

24:03.580 --> 24:05.670
Are you going to leave tomorrow morning?

24:07.340 --> 24:09.250
I've packed everything.

24:09.500 --> 24:10.760
I came to

24:10.780 --> 24:12.620
say goodbye to you, Mother.

24:14.370 --> 24:16.020
Everything in the North is different

24:16.020 --> 24:17.660
from that of Ling'an.

24:17.730 --> 24:19.560
Although it's your ancestral home,

24:19.780 --> 24:21.900
you've never been there before.

24:22.540 --> 24:24.350
You've suddenly been appointed there

24:24.370 --> 24:26.140
as the Protectorate General.

24:29.730 --> 24:31.330
I wonder if you

24:31.580 --> 24:33.290
can adapt to that place.

24:33.690 --> 24:35.130
Don't worry, Mother.

24:35.860 --> 24:37.660
The North is vast

24:37.890 --> 24:39.700
but underdeveloped.

24:40.210 --> 24:42.320
Jin entrusted it to me

24:42.340 --> 24:43.930
and said I shall do what I see fit

24:43.930 --> 24:45.370
to improve it.

24:46.450 --> 24:49.220
That's all I need to hear.

24:49.260 --> 24:51.760
In the past, with the Crown Prince above you,

24:51.780 --> 24:53.900
you were unappreciated.

24:55.170 --> 24:58.130
Now, you have a chance

24:58.130 --> 25:00.010
to realize your ambition.

25:03.210 --> 25:04.940
However, I'm not sure

25:06.260 --> 25:08.220
when I'll come back.

25:09.820 --> 25:11.130
I can no longer keep you company

25:11.130 --> 25:12.810
as before.

25:16.450 --> 25:18.810
Jin might still hold a grudge against you.

25:19.540 --> 25:21.900
That concerns me the most.

25:24.580 --> 25:26.020
Him?

25:26.970 --> 25:29.560
He's been visiting me regularly.

25:29.580 --> 25:31.020
Really?

25:31.890 --> 25:34.190
He doesn't say much

25:34.210 --> 25:36.000
and leaves after paying his respects,

25:36.020 --> 25:37.190
but

25:37.210 --> 25:39.570
he comes regardless.

25:40.730 --> 25:42.170
Very well.

25:42.690 --> 25:44.620
That's at least a good start.

25:45.890 --> 25:47.860
I think so, too.

25:48.690 --> 25:50.130
Zhang,

25:51.370 --> 25:53.220
keep walking with me

25:54.500 --> 25:56.460
when you still can.

25:59.130 --> 26:00.570
Yes, Your Highness.

26:02.890 --> 26:04.040
Your father

26:04.060 --> 26:06.530
and I will also leave soon to travel.

26:22.450 --> 26:23.840
(Earl Dongping's Mansion)
Zhan,

26:23.860 --> 26:25.450
do you need to bring

26:25.450 --> 26:26.950
a few maids with you

26:26.970 --> 26:28.060
to take care of

26:28.060 --> 26:29.670
your daily life?

26:29.690 --> 26:30.910
Father,

26:30.930 --> 26:32.020
I'm going to Yangui

26:32.020 --> 26:33.900
as the Envoy to the Southwest

26:33.970 --> 26:34.860
to make sure both sides

26:34.860 --> 26:36.560
trade safely.

26:36.580 --> 26:38.520
I'm not going on a trip.

26:39.100 --> 26:40.240
Besides,

26:40.260 --> 26:41.210
I have arms and legs.

26:41.210 --> 26:42.690
I can look after myself.

26:44.060 --> 26:45.630
I'm more worried about you.

26:45.860 --> 26:47.430
When Si and I are away,

26:47.450 --> 26:49.040
take good care of yourself.

26:49.060 --> 26:50.350
Act your age,

26:50.370 --> 26:51.810
alright?

26:52.580 --> 26:53.620
You'll be going there

26:53.620 --> 26:54.930
all alone.

26:54.930 --> 26:55.820
I can't stop

26:55.820 --> 26:57.730
worrying about you.

27:03.060 --> 27:04.610
Who told you I'd go alone?

27:05.650 --> 27:08.250
Who's going with you?

27:09.540 --> 27:10.980
Who else?

27:13.580 --> 27:16.900
Is Chuchu going to join you?

27:17.860 --> 27:19.900
I guess.

27:20.130 --> 27:22.040
Good for you.

27:22.060 --> 27:23.060
Look at her

27:23.060 --> 27:24.100
willing to

27:24.100 --> 27:25.860
go so far with you.

27:25.860 --> 27:26.970
You should marry her

27:26.970 --> 27:28.350
as soon as possible!

27:28.370 --> 27:29.370
Be committed.

27:29.370 --> 27:30.300
You should learn

27:30.300 --> 27:31.410
from me.

27:31.410 --> 27:32.450
Stop nagging.

27:32.450 --> 27:34.420
We have our own plan.

27:35.100 --> 27:36.560
What plan?

27:36.580 --> 27:38.860
You don't need a plan for such things.

27:48.540 --> 27:50.520
You'll leave soon.

27:50.540 --> 27:51.950
Congratulations

27:51.970 --> 27:53.620
on being the Envoy.

27:54.970 --> 27:57.940
We can hardly

27:58.210 --> 28:00.530
see each other again, right?

28:02.890 --> 28:04.330
I guess.

28:05.620 --> 28:07.100
Is there anything you want to

28:07.100 --> 28:08.540
say to me?

28:14.930 --> 28:16.370
Chuchu,

28:20.650 --> 28:23.460
I've been wanting to tell you...

28:28.500 --> 28:29.940
I...

28:39.450 --> 28:40.890
No.

28:51.300 --> 28:54.050
What are you going to do next?

28:56.650 --> 28:58.090
Me?

28:58.820 --> 29:00.660
The same as before.

29:01.820 --> 29:03.380
It's a big world.

29:03.540 --> 29:05.190
I'll enjoy it as much as possible

29:05.210 --> 29:06.660
and explore it.

29:06.890 --> 29:07.780
I can't be

29:07.780 --> 29:09.420
confined to one place.

29:13.020 --> 29:14.460
It makes sense.

29:14.730 --> 29:16.460
You're a heroine after all.

29:17.690 --> 29:19.460
May you

29:19.500 --> 29:21.170
live your best life

29:21.170 --> 29:22.860
every day.

29:25.500 --> 29:26.450
Well,

29:26.450 --> 29:27.890
Jiang Zhan,

29:27.930 --> 29:28.950
after everything

29:28.970 --> 29:30.770
we went through together,

29:31.100 --> 29:32.720
I realize although I want to

29:33.210 --> 29:34.670
be a heroine

29:34.690 --> 29:36.700
and see the world,

29:36.930 --> 29:38.810
I enjoy the most

29:39.970 --> 29:41.660
the life as it is

29:43.540 --> 29:45.050
to be with my love

29:46.540 --> 29:48.180
and do what I love.

29:50.130 --> 29:52.380
Be with your love

29:53.410 --> 29:54.850
and do...

29:59.650 --> 30:01.290
No one else is here!

30:06.890 --> 30:08.330
You love me?

30:12.020 --> 30:13.490
I love you!

30:14.020 --> 30:15.460
What?

30:16.730 --> 30:18.660
I love you!

30:18.970 --> 30:21.180
I didn't get that.

30:21.780 --> 30:23.020
I love you!

30:23.020 --> 30:26.290
I love you! I love you!

30:43.730 --> 30:46.050
It's a horse!

31:34.120 --> 31:36.960
(One Year Later)

31:36.960 --> 31:40.520
(Earl Dongping's Mansion)

31:40.540 --> 31:43.010
All the ingredients are ready.

31:43.100 --> 31:45.190
I see flowers!

31:45.340 --> 31:47.210
Si loves flower cakes the most.

31:47.210 --> 31:48.670
Add more honey.

31:48.690 --> 31:49.620
Yes, Grandmother.

31:49.620 --> 31:51.700
- We've got everything.
- Good.

31:52.020 --> 31:53.320
I wonder

31:53.340 --> 31:55.060
if she's gained or lost weight.

31:55.060 --> 31:56.580
I miss her dearly.

31:56.580 --> 31:57.910
Will she come back

31:57.930 --> 32:00.100
and leave again?

32:00.650 --> 32:02.330
- Grandmother.
- Grandmother.

32:02.580 --> 32:05.240
Welcome back, girls!

32:05.260 --> 32:06.870
I miss all of you!

32:06.890 --> 32:08.460
We miss you, too.

32:08.730 --> 32:09.820
Have a seat.

32:09.820 --> 32:11.260
Sure.

32:12.740 --> 32:13.620
Over the past year,

32:13.620 --> 32:15.250
I've read a lot of books.

32:15.740 --> 32:17.170
In Yang's Family Prescriptions,

32:17.170 --> 32:18.870
I found one for leg problems.

32:18.890 --> 32:20.370
I want to try it to treat your legs.

32:20.370 --> 32:21.540
How sweet.

32:21.540 --> 32:23.280
You care so much about me.

32:23.300 --> 32:24.910
You've changed so much

32:24.930 --> 32:26.760
since we met last time.

32:26.780 --> 32:29.000
You look more like

32:29.020 --> 32:30.450
a refined scholar

32:30.450 --> 32:32.900
than an ordinary girl.

32:33.820 --> 32:35.290
I'm flattered.

32:35.500 --> 32:37.730
It's all thanks to Si.

32:37.820 --> 32:39.110
Without her,

32:39.130 --> 32:41.460
I wouldn't have taken the first step.

32:41.860 --> 32:44.620
Let bygones be bygones.

32:44.690 --> 32:46.080
From now on,

32:46.100 --> 32:47.430
you'll lead a wonderful life.

32:47.450 --> 32:49.220
Yinlou greets you, Lady Jiang.

32:51.130 --> 32:52.570
Commandant Xie.

32:55.300 --> 32:56.630
Welcome, Commandant Xie.

32:56.650 --> 32:57.780
Yi needs to pound

32:57.780 --> 32:59.670
more flowers to make flower cakes.

32:59.690 --> 33:01.380
Go and help her.

33:17.730 --> 33:18.760
What are you waiting for?

33:18.780 --> 33:20.220
Give me a hand.

33:20.890 --> 33:22.330
Sure.

33:48.050 --> 33:48.930
Anmou,

33:48.930 --> 33:50.540
you're terrible

33:50.540 --> 33:52.220
at making dough.

33:52.260 --> 33:54.320
Look how watery it is.

33:54.340 --> 33:56.100
We're making flower cakes,

33:56.100 --> 33:58.330
not flower paste.

33:58.500 --> 33:59.980
You only talk the talk.

34:00.100 --> 34:01.020
Do it yourself.

34:01.020 --> 34:02.990
No problem. I'll make it.

34:03.010 --> 34:03.850
It's so thin.

34:03.850 --> 34:05.290
Add some flour.

34:08.100 --> 34:09.020
Stop, stop, stop!

34:09.020 --> 34:10.690
How much are you going to pour?

34:10.690 --> 34:11.900
How much do you need?

34:11.900 --> 34:12.770
I said add some flour.

34:12.770 --> 34:13.810
A tad would be enough.

34:13.810 --> 34:15.620
- I did.
- You poured a whole bag!

34:15.620 --> 34:17.060
I added water, too...

34:17.060 --> 34:18.170
Enough, you two.

34:18.170 --> 34:19.920
Look what you two have done.

34:19.940 --> 34:20.940
The dough is

34:20.940 --> 34:22.330
getting bigger and bigger.

34:22.330 --> 34:23.480
I know, right?

34:23.500 --> 34:25.060
We can make

34:25.060 --> 34:26.620
enough flower cakes

34:26.620 --> 34:28.700
for everyone in town.

34:29.100 --> 34:30.020
Use more strength.

34:30.020 --> 34:32.220
See? Mother is doing much better.

34:52.840 --> 34:57.360
(Taiji Hall, Tiande Hall)

35:32.580 --> 35:33.790
There's something

35:33.810 --> 35:35.620
I've kept from you.

35:36.420 --> 35:38.000
We checked it out.

35:38.020 --> 35:40.730
Your mother, Su Ke, was born in Nanwu

35:41.020 --> 35:43.620
before Mr. Su adopted her at the border.

35:43.810 --> 35:44.920
Since then,

35:44.940 --> 35:46.770
you've been bonded with Nanwu.

35:47.770 --> 35:50.100
The Saintess has to
go through life and death.

35:50.580 --> 35:52.140
You must've seen

35:52.850 --> 35:55.140
the past before becoming it.

35:56.900 --> 35:58.230
You're right.

35:58.250 --> 36:00.450
I rose from death

36:01.730 --> 36:03.370
before having that totem.

36:04.900 --> 36:06.310
This classified scroll

36:06.330 --> 36:07.960
records the secrets

36:07.980 --> 36:09.770
of the Saintess.

36:31.040 --> 36:34.480
(Yu)

36:37.540 --> 36:38.920
It's Nanwu's ancient spell.

36:38.940 --> 36:40.790
If yearnings overlap,

36:40.810 --> 36:42.710
one may trade one's life

36:42.730 --> 36:45.400
for a one-in-a-million chance

36:45.420 --> 36:47.330
to revive one's love.

36:47.540 --> 36:48.960
It was Yu Jin.

36:48.980 --> 36:50.830
He bet his life

36:50.850 --> 36:53.890
on the slim chance of changing my fate.

36:54.460 --> 36:55.900
Yes.

36:56.500 --> 36:59.930
He lost not only his life

37:00.420 --> 37:01.970
but also all his memories of you.

37:01.970 --> 37:05.450
♪ Shattering the dreams ♪

37:05.470 --> 37:09.350
♪ How many petals fell, I count ♪

37:09.370 --> 37:11.790
♪ It equals the times I think about you ♪

37:11.810 --> 37:13.210
Darling,

37:14.130 --> 37:15.570
I miss you so much.

37:17.730 --> 37:19.410
I miss you a lot, too.

37:19.860 --> 37:24.020
♪ I can't forget about you ♪

37:25.060 --> 37:27.060
(Yu Jin has been)

37:27.100 --> 37:29.250
(my one and only love.)

37:31.020 --> 37:37.610
♪ During my lifetime ♪

37:41.650 --> 37:45.070
♪ Can I still make it through the long night ♪

37:45.090 --> 37:48.790
♪ I fear that we'll part again ♪

37:50.060 --> 37:51.980
I dreamed of holding you like this

37:51.980 --> 37:53.620
a million times,

37:55.330 --> 37:57.520
but every time I woke up,

37:57.540 --> 37:59.100
I was here all alone.

38:00.810 --> 38:02.730
Come to think of it,

38:03.690 --> 38:04.770
during all those years

38:04.770 --> 38:06.700
when I guarded the border,

38:07.330 --> 38:08.770
I was alone, too,

38:09.770 --> 38:11.660
but I never felt lonely.

38:14.580 --> 38:16.060
Relax.

38:16.580 --> 38:18.450
You won't feel lonely anymore.

38:19.170 --> 38:20.740
I'm back.

38:24.420 --> 38:26.620
That depends on if you'll leave again.

38:26.640 --> 38:30.740
♪ The past fades as old dreams return ♪

38:31.690 --> 38:33.370
I won't.

38:33.540 --> 38:37.400
♪ I can't forget about you ♪

38:37.420 --> 38:41.110
♪ However long the road is ♪

38:41.130 --> 38:44.710
♪ No matter the cost,
I'll try to restore ♪

38:44.710 --> 38:51.920
♪ The sealed memories ♪

39:00.290 --> 39:02.100
I had a dream last night.

39:02.250 --> 39:03.690
I saw

39:04.330 --> 39:05.960
we built a home in Ling'an.

39:05.980 --> 39:07.450
Were you homesick again?

39:07.620 --> 39:09.370
What was our home like there?

39:10.540 --> 39:12.180
There was you, of course,

39:12.420 --> 39:14.020
and all our family.

39:14.060 --> 39:15.500
Everyone was there.

39:15.540 --> 39:16.420
Did I have to go on

39:16.420 --> 39:18.020
guarding the border?

39:18.130 --> 39:19.170
In that dream,

39:19.170 --> 39:21.600
Dazhou and Nanwu made peace.

39:21.620 --> 39:23.080
No more war.

39:23.100 --> 39:24.420
People on both sides

39:24.420 --> 39:26.370
led a happy and peaceful life.

39:27.460 --> 39:28.920
I can't wait

39:28.940 --> 39:30.580
for that day to come.

39:31.580 --> 39:33.150
How I wish

39:33.170 --> 39:35.100
we had made peace

39:35.250 --> 39:36.690
decades ago.

39:36.770 --> 39:37.770
That way,

39:37.770 --> 39:39.410
your exile to the border

39:39.580 --> 39:41.220
as a baby,

39:41.650 --> 39:43.370
your cruel experience

39:43.500 --> 39:45.770
on the battlefield as a teenager,

39:46.060 --> 39:47.520
and all your suffering

39:47.540 --> 39:49.220
would've been avoided.

39:50.690 --> 39:51.730
Actually,

39:51.730 --> 39:53.540
it was exactly such suffering

39:53.580 --> 39:55.810
that led me to you bit by bit.

39:56.250 --> 39:58.620
I was born into this world

39:58.900 --> 40:01.890
to find you and bond with you.

40:23.520 --> 40:26.520
(Taiji Hall)

40:26.520 --> 40:29.080
(Tiande Hall)

40:41.100 --> 40:43.660
The Empress has arrived!

41:19.980 --> 41:21.630
I, Jiang Si,

41:21.650 --> 41:23.920
humbly accept His Majesty's grace

41:23.940 --> 41:25.520
to be crowned Empress.

41:25.540 --> 41:27.920
I'll devoutly manage the harem

41:27.940 --> 41:30.720
and set an example for the realm.

41:30.810 --> 41:34.060
My gratitude for His Majesty's grace.

41:50.780 --> 41:52.510
♪ From place to place ♪

41:52.510 --> 41:57.450
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

41:57.820 --> 42:00.200
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

42:00.200 --> 42:04.150
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

42:04.170 --> 42:05.130
Kneel!

42:05.140 --> 42:07.920
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

42:08.900 --> 42:13.150
Long live, Your Majesty!

42:13.170 --> 42:14.500
Long live,

42:14.500 --> 42:17.630
Your Highness!

42:17.650 --> 42:19.090
Bow!

42:22.250 --> 42:23.690
Bow again!

42:24.830 --> 42:28.910
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

42:29.150 --> 42:30.890
♪ Like shadows ♪

42:30.910 --> 42:35.610
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

42:35.610 --> 42:39.180
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

42:39.200 --> 42:43.430
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

42:43.450 --> 42:45.230
♪ Time glows ♪

42:45.230 --> 42:49.770
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

42:49.790 --> 42:54.590
♪ And stars ♪

42:57.120 --> 43:01.360
(The End)

43:01.771 --> 43:03.501
♪ From place to place ♪

43:03.501 --> 43:08.441
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

43:08.811 --> 43:11.191
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:11.191 --> 43:15.421
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:16.131 --> 43:18.531
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:18.551 --> 43:22.211
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:22.231 --> 43:25.651
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:25.801 --> 43:31.321
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:32.141 --> 43:35.821
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:35.821 --> 43:39.901
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:40.141 --> 43:41.881
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:41.901 --> 43:46.601
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:46.601 --> 43:50.171
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:50.191 --> 43:54.421
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:54.441 --> 43:56.221
♪ Time glows ♪

43:56.221 --> 44:00.761
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:00.781 --> 44:05.581
♪ And stars ♪

44:09.811 --> 44:12.341
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:12.361 --> 44:15.981
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:16.001 --> 44:19.431
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:19.451 --> 44:24.071
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:24.071 --> 44:27.761
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:27.781 --> 44:31.871
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:31.981 --> 44:33.801
♪ Time glows ♪

44:33.801 --> 44:38.351
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:38.371 --> 44:42.071
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:42.091 --> 44:46.251
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:46.431 --> 44:48.191
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:48.191 --> 44:52.711
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:52.711 --> 44:56.351
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

44:56.371 --> 45:02.041
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

45:03.731 --> 45:05.661
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

45:05.661 --> 45:13.161
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
